</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5e752da0-7541-11f1-b7b0-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-08T040056Z-192424626-RC20L9A97BOA-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS-CHINA-ECOMMERCE.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5e752da0-7541-11f1-b7b0-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-08T040056Z-192424626-RC20L9A97BOA-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS-CHINA-ECOMMERCE.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">48f0cb32-7bcd-11f1-9b5c-915dd6cc87d8</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 19:35:03 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5e752da0-7541-11f1-b7b0-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-08T040056Z-192424626-RC20L9A97BOA-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS-CHINA-ECOMMERCE.jpg">© Dado Ruvic / Reuters</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国</category><title>谁想引渡法国足球队队长姆巴贝？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD/20260709-%E8%B0%81%E6%83%B3%E5%BC%95%E6%B8%A1%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E8%B6%B3%E7%90%83%E9%98%9F%E9%98%9F%E9%95%BF%E5%A7%86%E5%B7%B4%E8%B4%9D</link><description>
