</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2f47483e-7b03-11f1-aa3f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T043719Z-198924916-RC238MASZ7N1-RTRMADP-3-ASIA-WEATHER-CHINA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2f47483e-7b03-11f1-aa3f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-07T043719Z-198924916-RC238MASZ7N1-RTRMADP-3-ASIA-WEATHER-CHINA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">25123b76-7b7b-11f1-a048-6f763388c1c3</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 11:01:23 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>美军空袭伊朗东北部中伊铁路走廊上的一座桥梁，该路线也被俄罗斯使用</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260709-%E7%BE%8E%E5%86%9B%E7%A9%BA%E8%A2%AD%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E5%8C%97%E9%83%A8%E4%B8%AD%E4%BC%8A%E9%93%81%E8%B7%AF%E8%B5%B0%E5%BB%8A%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%A7%E6%A1%A5%E6%A2%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E8%B7%AF%E7%BA%BF%E4%B9%9F%E8%A2%AB%E4%BF%84%E7%BD%97%E6%96%AF%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8</link><description>
